    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "###Welcome to AI Makerspace! \n\nStart with a vision, develop your skills, then bring it to life with AI!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ab398ff421cc49dda5ad4547c45ea4ce-Panel 2.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-skill-check-learn-77154340-dc52-4657-9564-a3af6ae5dbe5",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Your path to building\n\nYou will begin with a skill check to find your starting point on the skill map.\n\nThen you choose checkpoints to learn and apply new skills to your project.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3874ea1c9e3392f3e764d9391baa8910-skill-check-starting-point_matched-spacing_1600.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-skill-check-learn-06348056-e331-4d44-ba0a-c68f83ffa596"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-skill-check-learn-60807e67-6964-43c3-ab7e-497261d32117",
        "text": "###Practice and apply\nEach checkpoint has two parts:\n-  First, practice a new skill. \n- Then, use the skill to build your own website.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6a025fff6fdb74348ca1fcb57b81c350-checkpoint-practice-apply-lower_1600.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-skill-check-learn-c0eda26c-9442-4968-a1de-987387c356ab",
        "text": "###Keep learning\n\nReturn to the skill map and choose your next checkpoint.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c33034d95807d71da7ee70c009b24298-return-to-skill-map-green-paths_1600.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Build something that’s yours.\nCreate a website that reflects your interests and ideas. \n\nWhat will you make?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/99d7f396c47a604d6ca01825a08c4ab2-Panel 1.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-skill-check-learn-9df6877a-dd61-421d-8e89-7f84f768137d"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "View a skills map outlining the abilities you will develop. This skill check helps tailor support to your needs without judgment.",
